---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About RKMIDIGILABS"
  description="About RKMIDIGILABS — AI Governance & Enterprise GRC advisory practice, corporate training, and daily video media hub."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-20">
    
    <div class="space-y-4 mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded bg-slate-100 border border-slate-300 text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase text-slate-700">
        About the Organization
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-black tracking-tight leading-tight">
        RKMIDIGILABS: AI Governance & Enterprise GRC
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-normal">
        Bridging the gap between software engineering, data science, and boardroom regulatory compliance.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-800 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200 pt-8 font-normal">
      <p>
        <strong>RKMIDIGILABS</strong> was founded to address the unique compliance, safety, and risk challenges introduced by Generative AI, machine learning systems, and foundation models.
      </p>
      
      <p>
        While traditional GRC operated on deterministic software systems with rigid checklists, modern AI introduces probabilistic risks—such as hallucinations, bias, model drift, and prompt injections. Major regulatory frameworks—including the European Union's <strong>EU AI Act</strong>, the U.S. <strong>NIST AI RMF</strong>, and international <strong>ISO/IEC 42001</strong> standards—now impose legal obligations on model deployers and providers.
      </p>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 my-8">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-black mb-2">Our Mission</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          To provide pragmatic, technical, and audit-ready guidance that allows enterprises to innovate boldly with artificial intelligence while establishing ironclad safety and compliance safeguards.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-black tracking-tight pt-4">
        Company Contact Information
      </h2>
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 border border-slate-300 space-y-2 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800">
        <div><strong class="text-black">Organization:</strong> RKMIDIGILABS</div>
        <div><strong class="text-black">Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:rkmvedant@gmail.com" class="text-[#16A34A] hover:underline font-bold">rkmvedant@gmail.com</a></div>
        <div><strong class="text-black">Mobile:</strong> <a href="tel:+919371650121" class="text-[#16A34A] hover:underline font-bold">+91 9371650121</a></div>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-200 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <a 
          href="/contact" 
          class="px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold text-sm bg-[#16A34A] hover:bg-[#15803D] text-white transition-colors shadow-sm"
        >
          Contact RKMIDIGILABS
        </a>
        <a 
          href="/blog" 
          class="px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold text-sm bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-800 border border-slate-300 transition-colors shadow-sm"
        >
          Browse Blog & Articles
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>